      "key": "SFCC-51",
      "summary": "Promotional Announcement Banner UI",
      "description": "As a \nShopper, \n\n\nI want\n to see a promotional announcement banner, \n\n\nso that\n I am informed of current promotions, offers, or announcements as I browse the site.\nReference image (Figma is leading):\nThe promotional announcement banner is a thin full-width bar displayed above the global header on all devices but select pages as per configuration.\nPage configuration:\n The banner needs to be configurable per page (e.g. it may display on Home / PDP / PLP, but it does not on Z.immerse).\nPosition flexibility: \nThe banner needs to be configurable per page on what position it needs to appear (e.g. Top of page on home page or below navigation).\nRotating behaviour:\n The banner supports multiple messages that rotate automatically. Each message can include text and an optional CTA link.\nContent dependency:\n Banner copy and rotation configuration is managed in Contentful. The component can be built with mock content prior to Contentful content model being finalised (contentful out of scope)",
